network AgentA ⟦
    dense ⟬2⸴ 4⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬4⸴ 1⟭ ·
⟧

network AgentB ⟦
    dense ⟬2⸴ 4⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬4⸴ 1⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary authA ⟦
        rule access_A ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    ethical_boundary authB ⟦
        rule access_B ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    vault vault_A with authA ⟬ AgentA ⟭ threshold ↦ 3 ·
    seal vault_A ·
    emit "Agent A vault sealed" ·

    unseal vault_A with authB ·
    emit "Unreachable" ·

    yield 0 ·
⟧

